    "en": {
      "trackName": "TikTocToe: Tic Tac Toe",
      "description": "TikTocToe is a Tic Tac Toe game for Apple Watch. Play a quick 3x3 round against the Coach on Easy or Hard, right on your wrist, with no account and no phone needed.\n\nAfter every game your Coach adds a short, kind line and a hand-drawn card that matches the result: a calm ring for a win, a busy braid when the Coach takes it, a morphing square for a draw.\n\nWHAT'S IN TIKTOCTOE\n- Classic 3x3 Tic Tac Toe, built for a quick round on your wrist\n- Easy and Hard opponents, tap to switch anytime\n- Fully offline, no account needed\n- A Coach with kind, playful commentary after every result, available even without a phone nearby\n- Ask Siri: \"Play Tic Tac Toe\" to start a fresh round, or \"Ask the coach for a tip\" for quick strategy\n- A hand-drawn look across the board and results\n- Your win, loss and draw stats, kept on your wrist and resettable anytime\n\nTikTocToe installs straight to your wrist. Just enjoy a calmer, better-looking round of the game you already know.",
      "releaseNotes": "Refreshed screenshots and App Store details, built with Xcode 27.1.\nThe game, the Coach and your stats are unchanged.",
